        "question": "How many replacement properties can I identify for an NNN retail exchange?",
        "answer": "Most investors use the three property rule, identifying up to three candidates of any value, or the two hundred percent rule, identifying more candidates as long as combined value does not exceed two hundred percent of the relinquished property value."
