        "question": "Who pays carrying costs on the parked property during a reverse exchange?",
        "answer": "Carrying costs, insurance, and property taxes on the parked property typically fall to the investor even though legal title sits with the Exchange Accommodation Titleholder during the parking period, and we track these obligations throughout."
