        "question": "How does preflight readiness affect closing timing?",
        "answer": "Having the package ready before the property is under contract, rather than assembling it after the fact, can meaningfully compress the time between a signed purchase agreement and an issued term sheet, which matters against the one hundred eighty day deadline."
